  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CSSF Jordan: Women Peace and Security Systems Strengthening (WPSSS)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Women Peace and Security Systems Strengthening project, also known as Tamasok, is a one-and-a-half year long programme implemented by Chemonics Group UK Ltd and Generations For Peace. Funded by the Foreign, Commonwealth &amp; Development Office (FCDO), WPSSS aims to enhance the participation of civil society organisations (CSOs) and women rights organisations (WROs) in the space of women, peace and security in Jordan.</narrative>
  </description>
